# BACKLOG - work packages

> **WP-28 is in progress on `wp/28-workplace-compose` and is paused. Do not start it from `main`;** it resumes on its
> own branch and merges `main` forward (steps in [WP-54 checkpoint](../.agent/checkpoints/WP-54.md)). Since WP-59 it redraws the
> baselines its change alters in its own sandbox with `npm run ui:visual:update` ([ADR-0049](decisions/ADR-0049-linux-renderer.md)), not on Windows.

Pick the lowest-numbered `ready` WP whose dependencies are `done` (AGENTS.md §3). Statuses: `ready`, `blocked` (reason),
`in-progress` (branch), `review` (PR), `done`, `superseded` (replacement WP). One WP = one branch = one PR. Size: S (< 1 day of agent work), M, L.
"Spec" points to the acceptance criteria; a WP is done only when they pass.

## Progress overview

Updated: 2026-11-02. Local main includes WP-00..WP-27 (WP-27 acceptance `6e00704`),
WP-36 and review corrections R1-R15, as approved by the maintainer. Historical branch checks and PR links remain
in the table; their GitHub PR state is not changed by this local merge.
See [main integration checkpoint](../.agent/checkpoints/MERGE-MAIN-WP24.md),
[review ledger](reviews/REVIEW-WP24.md) and the input-ref snapshot for exact coverage.

