**Completed implementation: 78% of historical rows** (29/37), or 81% of36 active
WPs after WP-29 consolidation into WP-28. WP-28 is next ready (12/20/21/22/25/26/27 done).
WP-27 acceptance:2895 tests/138 files,411 Storybook checks,169 Windows visual
comparisons and160 native screenshots. See [WP-27 checkpoint](../.agent/checkpoints/WP-27.md).

The recovered 12 WP-33 skills remain drafts pending WP-34 evals. The current
AGENTS.md and the completed UI Storybook procedure are preserved. WP-35 remains
blocked by external CP/DP integration; WP-28 is ready under ADR-0024.
